{"unit_id":"JeremyLyc__dsh-plugin-ssh#card-1","repo":"JeremyLyc/dsh-plugin-ssh","commit":"9deb9957ee0731f41b104bf769c083818e1a7342","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-ssh（DSH Web 插件）：把 SSH 远端服务器接入 DSH 工作区，让 agent 在绑定主机上执行命令并传输文件。插件注册工作区专属工具，并提供 SSH 远程侧栏、服务器文件页签和目录提示。主要功能包括运行远端命令、SFTP 上传下载、创建带主机绑定的工作区、浏览和预览服务器文件，以及切换远端工作目录。适合需要在 DSH 会话中操作远端 Linux 环境并查看服务器文件的开发者。需要 Node.js 20+、SSH 主机配置及相应认证凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:117-224","lib/index.js:294-596","lib/client.js:1061-1154"]}
{"unit_id":"JeremyLyc__dsh-plugin-ssh#card-2","repo":"JeremyLyc/dsh-plugin-ssh","commit":"9deb9957ee0731f41b104bf769c083818e1a7342","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-ssh connects SSH servers to DSH workspaces. Its session tools run commands and transfer files over SFTP. The web sidebar creates host-bound workspaces, browses remote folders, previews text, and changes directories. Requires Node.js 20+, SSH host configuration, and credentials.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:117-224","lib/index.js:294-596","lib/client.js:1061-1154"]}
